      "description": "OTel scope `eve-industry-planner/web` (API process). **`audience`** is `authenticated` (valid app JWT Bearer) or `anonymous`. **`web.frontend_events_total` counts only allowlisted *simple* event keys** — it does **not** include `new_job` (see *Job creates*) or `view_item_tree_item` (see *Item tree views*); those are recorded on separate counters with `type_id` labels. Each analytics batch item uses **`event`** + optional **`by_type`**; the SPA emits **`new_job`** and **`view_item_tree_item`** as separate batch rows so Prometheus rates below match backend `RecordJobCreates` vs `RecordItemTreeViews`.",
